1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,838
What if your worst haircut became your best escape

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:06,412
plan? This is Oh No My Hair, a two-player

3
00:00:06,325 --> 00:00:09,275
cooperative puzzle platformer by NPC Union.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,625
Two friends visit a salon at closing time.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,150
The barber leaves his robot assistant in charge.

6
00:00:17,912 --> 00:00:21,212
Then the scissors go wrong, their hair gains unexpected

7
00:00:21,125 --> 00:00:23,212
powers, and the front door locks.

8
00:00:23,987 --> 00:00:26,412
Escaping means learning to trust each other.

9
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:31,704
Twin-Tails can glide, pull levers, and carry her partner

10
00:00:31,617 --> 00:00:34,979
through the air. She creates routes and keeps a

11
00:00:34,892 --> 00:00:38,867
friend above danger. Her movement ability becomes a shared

12
00:00:38,779 --> 00:00:41,792
resource, rather than just a personal advantage.

13
00:00:43,533 --> 00:00:47,158
Pompadour can dash through gel, parry flying scissors, and

14
00:00:47,071 --> 00:00:48,696
launch a teammate from his head.

15
00:00:49,458 --> 00:00:51,158
His tools complement hers.

16
00:00:51,921 --> 00:00:53,546
One player opens a route;

17
00:00:53,758 --> 00:00:55,958
the other makes that route usable for both.

18
00:00:57,733 --> 00:01:00,033
Our signature moment is the sling dash.

19
00:01:00,796 --> 00:01:03,408
Twin-Tails carries Pompadour over a pit.

20
00:01:04,183 --> 00:01:06,633
He launches out of her grip, punches through a

21
00:01:06,546 --> 00:01:09,921
regrowing gel curtain, and she follows before it closes.

22
00:01:10,683 --> 00:01:12,996
The solution belongs to both players.

23
00:01:14,767 --> 00:01:17,892
Cooperation also changes what a projectile can do.

24
00:01:18,667 --> 00:01:20,267
Pompadour parries a scissor.

25
00:01:21,029 --> 00:01:23,667
Twin-Tails catches it with her hair and tosses it

26
00:01:23,579 --> 00:01:25,254
upward to ring a service bell.

27
00:01:26,017 --> 00:01:28,492
An enemy attack becomes the key to the next

28
00:01:28,404 --> 00:01:28,892
door.

29
00:01:30,633 --> 00:01:32,458
The salon is part of the puzzle.

30
00:01:33,221 --> 00:01:37,008
Water makes hair heavy and temporarily disables key abilities.

31
00:01:37,771 --> 00:01:41,021
Hair dryers restore those powers and create rising air

32
00:01:40,933 --> 00:01:45,446
currents. Familiar tools ask players to rethink their timing

33
00:01:45,358 --> 00:01:46,246
and their route.

34
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:52,413
The finale combines aimed scissors, overhead warnings, charging attacks,

35
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:54,562
showers, and roaming robots.

36
00:01:55,325 --> 00:01:58,475
Players create a counterattack window and strike together.

37
00:01:59,238 --> 00:02:02,413
Hair swaps can also exchange their roles, turning a

38
00:02:02,325 --> 00:02:05,363
familiar partnership into an unexpected challenge.

39
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:09,613
Better Together is our rule for level design.

40
00:02:10,375 --> 00:02:13,075
Carry me. Wait for the water.

41
00:02:13,838 --> 00:02:17,712
Parry now. A bad haircut becomes a warm story

42
00:02:17,625 --> 00:02:18,562
about trust.

43
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:23,712
Our audience is friends, siblings, and couples who enjoy

44
00:02:23,625 --> 00:02:26,212
cooperative puzzles and playful platforming.

45
00:02:26,988 --> 00:02:29,888
One shared keyboard and a browser make the prototype

46
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,125
easy to try together.

47
00:02:32,867 --> 00:02:35,892
PICO PARK 2 serves larger cooperative groups.

48
00:02:36,654 --> 00:02:39,504
Ibb and Obb explores two-player gravity puzzles.

49
00:02:40,267 --> 00:02:43,929
Our niche is two asymmetric hair abilities, combination moves,

50
00:02:44,004 --> 00:02:45,842
and a compact salon escape.

51
00:02:46,604 --> 00:02:48,629
We still need to validate demand.

52
00:02:50,367 --> 00:02:54,104
The prototype has four chapters, twelve rooms, a three-phase

53
00:02:54,017 --> 00:02:58,042
boss, story sequences, saved progression, and room replay.

54
00:02:58,817 --> 00:03:01,354
It is publicly playable on itch dot io.

55
00:03:02,129 --> 00:03:05,467
Future expansion will depend on testing with more pairs.

56
00:03:07,233 --> 00:03:10,471
Our indicative budgets are twenty thousand US dollars for

57
00:03:10,383 --> 00:03:14,421
a twelve-week minimum version, sixty thousand for twenty-four weeks,

58
00:03:14,671 --> 00:03:17,183
or one hundred and twenty thousand for an expanded

59
00:03:17,096 --> 00:03:22,246
thirty-six-week scope. These are planning estimates, not funding raised.

60
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:27,688
The minimum allocates twelve thousand to development, three thousand

61
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:30,275
to art and audio, one thousand to testing and

62
00:03:30,188 --> 00:03:32,825
tools, and four thousand to contingency.

63
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:36,212
Online multiplayer is outside this scope.

64
00:03:37,933 --> 00:03:40,821
Weeks one to four: playtests and onboarding.

65
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:45,371
Weeks five to eight: polish rooms, controls, and visual

66
00:03:45,283 --> 00:03:50,471
feedback. Weeks nine to twelve: accessibility checks, bug fixing,

67
00:03:50,533 --> 00:03:54,946
and release preparation. Expansion follows player evidence.

68
00:03:56,700 --> 00:04:00,125
Next, we plan to test twenty player pairs, tracking

69
00:04:00,038 --> 00:04:04,200
unaided tutorial completion, repeated failure points, and willingness to

70
00:04:04,112 --> 00:04:08,550
play another room. These are future validation targets, not

71
00:04:08,462 --> 00:04:10,150
achieved audience metrics.

72
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:17,425
We are NPC Union: ChenHongshan333 and ZSYUYIIE.

73
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:21,575
We are seeking playtest feedback and incubation support to

74
00:04:21,488 --> 00:04:23,600
polish this cooperative experience.

75
00:04:25,333 --> 00:04:27,321
Scan the code to play and tell us what

76
00:04:27,233 --> 00:04:29,946
you think. Oh No My Hair.

77
00:04:30,721 --> 00:04:33,346
Bad hair. Good friends.

78
00:04:34,121 --> 00:04:34,883
Thank you.
